flowchart LR
  source[Source-declared facts] --> ir[Document Form IR authority]
  ir --> canonical[Canonical IR bytes]
  canonical --> digest[IR content digest]
  canonical --> index[Index projection]
  index -. rebuildable .-> canonical
  rendered[Rendered/OCR observation] --> ir
  sourceBytes[Original file bytes] -. ingestion metadata only .-> source
  semantic[Semantic IR] -->|reads facts| ir
  ir -. does not infer meaning .-> semantic
